<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id">Revelation</book>
  <para style="h">Revelation</para>
  <para style="toc1">Revelation</para>
  <para style="toc2">Revelation</para>
  <para style="mt">Revelation</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Isua Krista thupuan chhuah, Pathianin a bâwihte hriattîr atân a hnêna a pêk, thil lo thleng thuai tûr thu chu; tin, chu chu a vântirhkoh hmangin a bâwih Johana a rawn hriattîr a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />chu Johana chuan Pathian thu leh Isua Krista hriattîrna thu, a thil hmuh zawng zawng thu chu a hriattîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />He hrilh lâwkna bu thu chhiartu leh ngaithlaa a chhûnga thu ziak pawmtute chu an eng a thâwl e; a hun chu a hnai tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Johana chuan, Asia rama kohhran pasarihte hnênah chuan: Awm mêka leh awm tawha leh lo la awm tûra hnên aṭang te, a lalṭhutphah hmaa Thlarau pasarih awmho hnên aṭang te, Isua Krista, thuhretu rinawm tak, mitthi zîng ata piang hmasa bera leh leia lalte rorêltute hnên aṭang te chuan, khawngaihna leh remna in hnênah awm rawh se. Min hmangaiha, a thisenin kan sualte lak ata min tlan chhuaka,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />khua leh tuiah leh a Pathian leh a Pa lama puithiama min siamtu hnênah, a ni, ama hnên ngeiah ropuina leh rorêlna chu chatuanin awm rawh se. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngai teh u, ani chu chhûmte nên chuan a lo kal dâwn e; mit tinrêngin an hmu ang a, a chhuntute ngei pawh khân; khawvêla hnam zawng zawngin amah an ṭah bawk ang. A ni, Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Kei Alpha leh Omega ka ni,” Lalpa Pathian, awm mêka leh awm tawha leh lo la awm tûra, Engkimtitheia chuan a ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kei Johana, in unaupa leh, Isuaa hrehawmna te, khua leh tui te, chhelna te ṭâwmpuitu che u hi, Pathian thu avâng leh Isua hriattîrna thu avângin Patmos thliarkâr an tihah chuan ka awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa nîah chuan Thlarauvin ka lo awm a; tin, ka hnung lamah tawtawrâwt ri ang, aw ring takin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“I thil hmuh tûr chu lehkhabuah ziak la, kohhran pasarihte hnênah - Ephesi khuaah te, Smurna khuaah te, Pergamos khuaah te, Thuatira khuaah te, Sardis khuaah te, Philadelphia khuaah te, Laodikei khuaah te chuan thawn rawh,” a tih ka hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, mi biakna aw chu hmuh tumin ka han lehhawi ta a. Tin, ka han lehhawi chuan rangkachak khâwnvâr dahna pasarih ka hmu a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />khâwnvâr dahna zîngah chuan mi tu emaw mihring fa ang, ke lêr thlenga puan sin, a âwma rangkachak kâwnghrena inhrêng ka hmu bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, a lû leh a sam chu berâm hmul vâr angin a vâr a, vûr ang maiin; a mitte chu mei alh ang a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />a kephahte chu dâr tle mi ang a ni a, rawh tuina meia rawh thianghlim tawh ang maiin; a aw chu tui tam tak ri ang mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, a kut ding lam chuan arsi pasarih a keng a; a kâ aṭang chuan khandaih hriam tawn hriam tak a chhuak a; a hmêl chu ni sat vânglai tak ang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, amah chu ka hmuh veleh thi ang dêrin a ke bulah ka tlu ta a. Tin, ani chuan a kut ding lam chu ka chungah nghatin ka hnênah, “Hlau suh ang che; kei Hmasabera leh Hnuhnûngbera leh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mi Nunga chu ka ni; ka lo thi a; nimahsela, ngai teh, kumkhua atân ka nung leh ta a ni. Thihna leh Mitthi Khaw chabite chu ka nei bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chutichuan, i thil hmuh tawhte leh thil awm mêkte leh, tûn hnua thil lo awm tûrte thu chu ziak rawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />ka kut ding lama arsi pasarih awm i hmuhte leh, rangkachak khâwnvâr dahna pasarihte thurûk chu. Arsi pasarih chu kohhran pasarihte tirhkoh an ni a; khâwnvâr pasarih chu kohhran pasarihte chu an ni e.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ephesi khuaa kohhranho tirhkoh hnênah chuan heti hian ziak rawh: ‘A kut ding lama arsi pasarih kenga, rangkachak khâwnvâr dahna pasarih zînga vei veia khân hêng thu hi a sawi a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I thiltih te, i thawh rimzia leh i chhelzia te, mi sual i ngaihtheih lohzia te ka hria. Tirhkoh ni si lova tirhkoh intite chu i fiah bawk a, dawthei an ni tih i lo hre tawh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />chhelna i nei bawk a, ka hming avângin i tuar tawh a, i chau si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nimahsela, demna che ka nei a ni, i hmangaihna hmasa ber kha i bân tâk avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutichuan, i tlûksan tâk chu hre reng la, simin, a tîra i thiltihte kha ti leh rawh; chuti lo chuan, i hnênah ka lo kal ang a, i sim loh zawngin i khâwnvâr dahna kha a hmun ata ka sawn ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nimahsela, hei hi i ṭhatna chu a ni, Nikola-ho thiltihte i huat hi; chu chu kei pawhin ka haw ve a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thlarauvin kohhranho hnêna thu a sawi hi beng nei chuan hre rawh se. A hnehtu apiang Pathian Paradis-a Nunna Thinga mi ka eitîr ang, a ti e,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Smurna khuaa kohhranho tirhkoh hnênah chuan heti hian ziak rawh: ‘Hmasabera leh Hnuhnûngbera, thia lo nung leh taa khân hêng thu hi a sawi a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />I hrehawmzia te, i pachhiatzia te (nimahsela, i hausa si a), Juda tak ni lova, Setana inkhâwmna inho ni zâwk sia, Juda intihoten an sawi chhiat dân che ka hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />I tuar tûrte hi hlau suh; ngai teh, fiaha in awm theih nân Diabola chuan in zînga mi ṭhenkhat tân inah a khung dâwn che u a ni; tin, ni sâwm hrehawm in tuar ang. Thih thlengin rinawmin lo awm rawh; tichuan, nunna lallukhum ka pe ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thlarauvin kohhranho hnêna thu a sawi hi beng nei chuan hre rawh se. A hnehtu apiang thih hnihna chuan eng mah a tih lo vang, a ti e,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Pergamos khuaa kohhran tirhkoh hnênah chuan heti hian ziak rawh: ‘Khandaih hriam tawn hriam tak neia khân hêng thu hi a sawi a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />I awmna, Setana ṭhutphah awmna kha ka hria; tin, ka hming i vawng tlat a, ka thu hretu Antipa, Setana awmnaa in zînga an thah, ka mi rinawm tak awm lai meuh pawh khân mi rinna hi i phatsan lo bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nimahsela, tlêmin demna che ka nei, khata Balaama zirtîrna thu pawm tute emaw in awmpui avâng khân; ani chuan milem biakna sa an eina tûr leh an inngaihna tûrin, Balaka chu Israela thlahte hmaah tlûkna dah a zirtîr kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang pawhin Nikola-ho zirtîrna thu chutiang bawka pawm tute emaw i awmpui bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutichuan, sim rawh; chuti lo chuan, i hnênah ka lo kal thuai ang a, ka kâa khandaih chuan anmahni ka rawn do vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thlarauvin kohhranho hnêna thu a sawi hi beng nei chuan hre rawh se. A hnehtu apiang hnên ngeiah chuan manna thuhrûk zînga mi ka pe ang a, lung vâr pawh ka pe ang, chumi lunga hming thar ziak nên; chu hming chu a changtu chauh lo chuan tu mân an hre lo, a ti e,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Thuatira khuaa kohhranho tirhkoh hnênah chuan heti hian ziak rawh: ‘Pathian Fapa, mit mei alh ang neia, a kephahte dâr tle mi anga khân hêng thu hi a sawi a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />I thiltih te, i hmangaihzia te, i rinzia te, i rawngbâwlzia te, i chhelzia te ka hria, i thiltih hnuhnûng berte chu a tîra mi ai khân a nasa zâwk tih ka hre bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nimahsela, demna che ka nei, hmeichhia Jezebeli, zâwlneinu intii kha i ngaihtheih avângin; ani chuan ka bâwihte chu inngaih leh milem biakna thil ei zirtîrin a hruai bo bawk ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, simna tûrin a hnênah hun bi ka tuk a; nimahsela, mi ngaih a chîn chu a sim duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ngai teh, amah chu khumah ka paih dâwn a ni; a uirêtute pawh chu, a thiltih chînte chu an simsan loh zawngin hrehawm nasa takah ka paih bawk dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A fate chu hriin ka tihlum bawk ang a; tichuan, kei hi rilru leh thinlung entu ka ni tih kohhranho zawng zawng chuan an hria ang; tin, in thiltih ang zêlin ka pe ṭheuh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nimahsela, nangni, Thuatira khuaa mi dang awm, chu zirtîrna thu pawm lova, Setana thil thûk an tihte hre lo apiang hnênah chuan, phurrit dang rêng ka bel lo vang che u, ka ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />In neih sa erawh kha chu ka lo kal hma loh chuan vawng tlat rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tichuan, a hnehtu apiang leh a tâwp thlenga ka thiltihte pawmtu apiang, keiin ka Pa laka ka hmuh ang bawk hian, chu mite chu hnam tin chungah thu ka neihtîr ang; tin, anni chuan bêlvawtu bêlte keh sawm depa a awm angin, thîr tiangin an ro a rêlsak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, vârparh arsi chu anmahni ka pe ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thlarauvin kohhranho hnêna thu a sawi hi beng nei chuan hre rawh se, a ti e,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Sardis khuaa kohhranho tirhkoh hnênah chuan heti hian ziak rawh: ‘Pathian Thlarau pasarih leh arsi pasarih neia khân hêng thu hi a sawi a ni: I thiltihte ka hria, thi reng sia nung hming i put hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Invêng la, i thil la neih thi lek lekte chu tinung leh rawh; i thiltihte rêng ka Pathian mit tlung zovin ka hmu si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chutichuan, i thu dawn leh ngaihthlâkte kha hre reng la, pawm la, sim rawh. I invên loh zawngin rûkru angin ka lo kal ang a, eng hunah nge ka rawn phâwk dâwn che i hre si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nimahsela, Sardis khuaah khân an puante tibawlhhlawh lo hming tlêm tê i nei a ni; anni chu puan vâr sinin ka hnênah an lêng ve ṭhîn ang; chutiang ti tlâk an ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A hnehtu apiang chutiangin puan vârte sintîr an ni ang; tin, Nunna Bu ata an hming chu ka thai bo tawp lo vang a, ka Pa hmaah leh a vântirhkohte hmaah chuan an hming ka ṭan zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thlarauvin kohhranho hnêna thu a sawi hi beng nei chuan hre rawh se, a ti e,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Philadelphia khuaa kohhranho tirhkoh hnênah chuan heti hian ziak rawh: ‘Mi thianghlima, mi dik taka, Davida chabi neia, tu ma khâr loh tûra hawnga, tu ma hawn loh tûra khâra khân hêng thu hi a sawi a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I thiltihte ka hria, chakna tlêm tê chauh i nei a, chuti chung pawhin ka thu i pawm a, ka hming pawh i phat lo va; tu ma khâr theih loh i hmaah kawngka ka hawng e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngai teh, Setana inkhâwmna in ho zînga mi, Juda tak ni lova, dâwt sawia Juda intite zînga mi chu ka tîr dâwn a ni; ngai teh, i ke bulah chibai ka rawn bûktîr ang a, ka hmangaih che tih ka hriattîr bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka chhelna thu i pawm avâng khân, leia awmte fiah tûra khawvêl zawng zawng chunga fiahna hun lo thleng tûr lakah chuan kei pawhin ka humhim ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka lo kal thuai dâwn e; tu mân i lallukhum chu an lâksak loh nân che, i thil neih sa kha vawng tlat rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A hnehtu apiang chu ka Pathian biak inah chuan banah ka siam ang a, chuta ṭang chuan an chhuak tawh lo vang; tin, anmahniah chuan ka Pathian hming nên, ka Pathian khua, Jerusalem Thar, ka Pathian hnêna mi vân aṭanga lo chhuk tûr hming nên, ka hming thar nên ka ziak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thlarauvin kohhranho hnêna thu a sawi hi beng nei chuan hre rawh se, a ti e,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Laodikei khuaa kohhranho tirhkoh hnênah chuan heti hian ziak rawh: ‘Amena - thuhretu rinawm leh dik taka, Pathian thilsiam bula khân hêng thu hi a sawi a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />I thiltihte ka hria, i vawh hek lohva, i lum hek loh hi; i vawh emaw, i lum emaw ka duh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutichuan, lum si lova, vâwt si lova, i lum chang chang avângin ka ka ata ka chhâk chhuak dâwn a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka hausa a, sum ka ngah a, eng mah ka tlachham lo ve, i tih avâng leh, nang mi rethei, khawngaihthlâk, pachhia, mitdel, saruak chu i ni tih i inhriat loh avângin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />i lo hausak theih nân rangkachak meia tihthianghlim te, puan i sin theih nân leh i saruak zahmawh chu a lan loh nân puan vâr te, i hmuh theih nân i mita hnawihah mit na hlo te ka hnêna mi lei tûrin ka râwn a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka hmangaih apiang ka zilhhauvin ka thunun ṭhîn; chutichuan, ṭhahnemngai la, sim rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ngai teh, kawngkhâr bula dingin ka kik hi; tu pawhin ka aw hriaa kawng a hawn chuan, a hnênah ka lût ang a, a hnênah zanriah ka ei ang a, ani pawhin ka hnênah a ei bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A hnehtu apiang ka lalṭhutphahah ka hnênah ka ṭhuttîr ang, kei pawhin ka hneha, ka Pa hnênah a lalṭhutphaha ka ṭhu ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thlarauvin kohhran pawlho hnêna thu a sawi hi beng nei chuan hre rawh se, a ti e,’ tiin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chûng thil hnuah chuan ka han en a; tin, ngai teh, vânah kawngkhâr inhawng ka hmu a; tin, aw ka hriat hmasak, tawtawrâwt ri anga mi bia khân, “Hetah lo chho rawh; tichuan, tûn hnua thil lo awm tûrte chu ka entîr ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chawplehchilhin Thlarauvin ka lo awm ta nghâl a; tin, ngai teh, vânah lalṭhutphah a lo inhûng a, chu ṭhutphahah chuan mi pakhat a lo ṭhu bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, a chunga ṭhua chu jaspi leh sardion lung ang maiin a lang a; tin, lalṭhutphah vêlah chuan chhimbâl, ena smaragdin lung ang a zâm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, lalṭhutphah vêlah chuan lalṭhutphah sawmhnih leh pali a awm a; tin, lalṭhutphahahte chuan upa sawmhnih leh pali puan vâr sina ṭhu ka hmu a; rangkachak lallukhumte an khum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, lalṭhutphah aṭang chuan kâwlphe te, aw te, khawpui ri te a lo chhuak dur dur a. Tin, lalṭhutphah hmaah chuan meichher pasarih a alh a, chûng chu Pathian Thlarau pasarihte kha an ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tin, lalṭhutphah hmaah chuan dârthlalang tuifinriat ang, krustal lung ang mai a awm a; tin, lalṭhutphah laiah leh lalṭhutphah vêlah chuan Thil nung pali, hma lam leh hnung lam mita khat an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Thil nung pakhatna chu sakeibaknei ang a ni a, Thil nung pahnihna chu sebâwngno ang a ni a, Thil nung pathumna chuan mihring hmel ang a pu a, Thil nung palina chu mupui thlâwk lai ang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Thil nung pali chu thla paruk ṭheuh nei, an vêl leh an chhûnga mita khat an ni. Tin, “Lalpa Pathian, Engkimtitheia, Awm tawha leh, awm mêka leh, lo la awm tûra chu, A thianghlim e, a thianghlim e, a thianghlim e,” tiin, chhûn leh zân an châwl ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Thil nungte chuan lalṭhutphaha ṭhua, chatuana nung renga chu, an tihropuia an chawimawia, lâwmthu an hrilh apiangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />upa sawmhnih leh palite chu lalṭhutphaha ṭhua hmaah chuan an bawkkhup ang a, chatuana nung renga chu chibai an bûk ang a, “Nang, kan Lalpa leh kan Pathian, Ropuina te, chawimawina te, thiltihtheihna te chu Hmu tlâk i ni e; Nangin engkim i siam a, I duh avânga awm leh siam An ni bawk si a,” tiin, an lallukhumte chu lalṭhutphah hmaah chuan an dah ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, lalṭhutphaha ṭhua kut ding lamah chuan lehkhabu, chhûng lam leh pâwn lama ziak, chhinchhiahna pasariha chhinchhiah tlat ka hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, vântirhkoh chak tak, aw ring taka, “Tu nge lehkhabu hi hawnga, a chhinchhiahnate hi phelh tlâk awm?” tia tlângauvin ka hmu bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chutichuan, vânah te, leiah te, lei hnuaiah te pawh lehkhabu chu hawng thei tu mah an awm lo va, a chhûng lam en thei pawh an awm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, lehkhabu hawng leh, a chhûng lam pawh en tlâk tu mah an awm loh avângin ka ṭap ta zawih zawih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, upa zinga pakhat chuan ka hnênah, “Ṭap suh; ngai teh, Sakeibaknei, Juda hnama mi, Davida Bulpui khân lehkhabu chu hawng tûr leh, a chhinchhiahna pasarih phelh tûrin a hneh ta,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, lalṭhutphah leh Thil nung palite laiah, upate lai bawkah chuan Berâmno talh tawh hnu ang, ki pasarih leh mit pasarih nei ding ka hmu a, chûng mit pasarihte chu Pathian Thlarau pasarih, lei chung zawng zawnga tirh chhuahte chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, ani chu a lo kal a, lalṭhutphaha ṭhua kut ding lam ata lehkhabu chu a la ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, lehkhabu chu a lâk veleh Thil nung pali leh upa sawmhnih leh palite chu ṭingṭang leh rangkachak berhbu, rimtuia khat keng ṭheuhvin, Berâmno hmaah chuan an bawkkhup ta hlawm a; chûng rimtuite chu mi thianghlimte ṭawngṭaina a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, “Nang, lehkhabu chu laa, A chhinchhiahnate phelh tlâk i ni e; Talhin i awm tawh a, Chi tina mi te, ṭawng tina mi te, Mi tina mi te, hnam tina mi te, Pathian tân i thisenin i lei a, Kan Pathian tân khua leh tuiah leh, Puithiamahte i siam ta si a; Tin, leiah chuan ro an rêl a,” tiin hla thar an sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, ka han en a; tin, lalṭhutphah leh Thil nungte leh upate vêlah chuan vântirhkoh tam tak aw ka hria a; an tam lam chu a sînga sîng hmun sîng tam tak leh, a sânga sâng hmun sâng tam tak an ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />chûngte chuan aw ring takin, “Berâmno talh tawha hi, Thiltihtheihna te, hausakna te, finna te, Chakna te, Chawimawina te, ropuina te, Malsâwmna te hmu tlâk a ni e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, vân leh lei chung leh lei hnuai leh tuifinriat chhûnga thilsiam tinrêng awmte leh, chûngho chhûnga awm zawng zawngten, “Lalṭhutphaha ṭhua leh, Berâmno hnênah chuan, Malsâwmna te, chawimawina te, Ropuina te, rorêlna te, Chatuanin awm rawh se,” an tih ka hre bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Thil nung palite chuan, “Amen,” an ti a. Upate pawh chuan bawkkhupin chibai an bûk ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Berâmno chuan chhinchhiahna pasarih zînga pakhat chu a han phelh lai ka hmu a; tin, Thil nung palite zînga pakhat chuan khawpui ri ang maiin, “Lo kal rawh,” a tih ka hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tichuan, ka han en a; tin, ngai teh, sakawr vâr ka hmu a, a chunga chuang chuan thal ngul a keng a; tin, a hnênah chuan lallukhum an pe a; tin, hneh chung leh hneh zêl tûrin a chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, chhinchhiahna pahnihna chu a han phelh veleh Thil nung pahnihna chuan, “Lo kal rawh,” a tih ka hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tichuan, sakawr dang, a sen a lo chhuak leh a; tin, a chunga chuang hnênah chuan lei ata inremna lâksak theihna leh mi inthahtîr theihna an pe a; tin, a hnênah khandaih lian pui an pe bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, chhinchhiahna pathumna chu a han phelh veleh Thil nung pathumna chuan, “Lo kal rawh,” a tih ka hria a. Tichuan, ka han en a, tin, ngai teh, sakawr dum ka hmu a; a chunga chuang chuan bûkna a keng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Thil nung palite lai aṭang chuan aw angreng hian, “Duliin buhpui tehkhâwng khat, duliin barli tehkhâwng thum; hriak leh uain erawh chu tichhe suh,” a tih ka hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, chhinchhiahna palina chu a han phelh veleh Thil nung palina aw chuan, “Lo kal rawh,” a tih ka hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, ka han en a; tin, ngai teh, sakawr dâng ka hmu a; a chunga chuang hming chu Thihnaa a ni; tin, Mitthi Khuaan a rawn zui a. Tin, khandaih te, ṭâm te, hri te, leia sakawlhtea tihlum tûrin chu mite hnênah chuan lei hmun lia ṭhena hmun khat chunga thuneihna an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, chhinchhiahna pangana chu a han phelh veleh, maichâm hnuaiah chuan, Pathian thu avâng leh an pawm hriattîrna thu avânga thahte thlarau chu ka hmu a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tin, anni chuan aw ring takin, “Aw Lalpa, mi thianghlim leh dik tak, eng chen nge rorêl lovin, leia awmte chungah kan thisen chhuahna phuba chu la lova i awm dâwn le?” tiin an au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah chuan puan vâr an pe ṭheuh va; tin, an bâwihpuite leh an unaute, anmahni ang bawka thah tûrte chu an thah kim hma loh chuan an la nghâk rih tûr a ni tih an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, chhinchhiahna parukna chu a han phelh lai ka en reng a; tin, lîr nasa takin a lo nghîng ta a; tin, ni chu sahmul saiip puan angin a lo dum a, thla pawh chu a pumin thisen angin a lo awm ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tin, vâna arsite chu theipui kûng thlipuiin a nuaia, a helte a ṭîl ang maiin leiah a tla ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, vân chu lehkhabu zial mi ziala a bo angin a bo ta a; tin, tlâng leh thliarkâr tinrêng chu an awmna ata sawnin an awm ta hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, leia lal te, mi lian te, sipai hotu ber te, mi hausa te, mi chak te, bâwih leh bâwih lo tinrêngte chu pûkah leh tlânga lungpuiah chuan an biru a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tin, tlângte leh lungpuite hnênah chuan, “Min delh ula, lalṭhutphaha ṭhua hmêl lakah leh Berâmno thinurna lakah min hliah rawh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />a thinurna ni râpthlâk tak chu a lo thlen tâk hi; tichuan, tu nge ding thei ang i le?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi hnuah chuan khawmualah leh, tuifinriatah leh, thing rêng rêngah chuan thli rêng a tleh loh nân, lei thli pali chu chelhin lei kil lia ding vântirhkoh pali ka hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, vântirhkoh dang, Pathian nung chhinchhiahna kenga ni chhuahnaa chho ka hmu bawk a; tin, ani chuan vântirhkoh pali, khawmual leh tuifinriat tihchhiat theihna pêkate hnênah chuan aw ring takin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Kan Pathian bâwihte chu an chala kan chhinchhiah hma loh zawng khawmual leh tuifinriat leh thingte chu tichhe rih suh u,” tiin a au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, an chhinchhiah zât chu ka lo hria a, Israela thlahte hnam tina mi nuai khat leh sîngli leh sângli an chhinchhiah tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Juda hnama mi sîngkhat leh sânghnih, Reubena hnama mi sîngkhat leh sânghnih, Gada hnama mi sîngkhat leh sânghnih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Asera hnama mi sîngkhat leh sânghnih, Naphtalia hnama mi sîngkhat leh sânghnih, Manasea hnama mi sîngkhat leh sânghnih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Simeona hnama mi sîngkhat leh sânghnih, Levia hnama mi sîngkhat leh sânghnih, Isakara hnama mi sîngkhat leh sânghnih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zebuluna hnama mi sîngkhat leh sânghnih, Josefa hnama mi sîngkhat leh sânghnih, Benjamina hnama mi sîngkhat leh sânghnih, an chhinchhiah tawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chûng hnuah chuan ka han en a; tin, ngai teh, mipui tam tak, tu ma chhiar sên loh, hnam tin zînga mi te, chi tin zînga mi te, mi tin zînga mi te, ṭawng tin zinga mi te puan vâr sina tûmkau kengin, lalṭhutphah hmaah leh Berâmno hmaa ding ka hmu a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tin, chûngte chuan aw ring takin, “Kan Pathian lalṭhutphaha ṭhua hnênah leh, Berâmno hnênah chhandamna,” tiin an au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, vântirhkoh zawng zawng chu lalṭhutphah leh upate leh Thil nung palite vêlah chuan dingin an awm a; lalṭhutphah hmaah chuan bawkkhupin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Amen: malsâwmna te, ropuina te, finna te, Lâwm thu sawina te, chawimawina te, Thiltihtheihna te, chakna te, Chatuanin kan Pathian hnênah awm rawh se. Amen,” tiin Pathian chibai an bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, upa zînga pakhat chuan ka hnênah, “Hêng puan vâr sinte hi tute nge nia, khawi aṭanga lo kal nge an nih?” tiin mi bia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, kei chuan a hnênah, “Ka pu, nangman i hria alâwm,” ka ti a. Tin, anin ka hnênah, “Hêng hi hrehawm nasa tak ata chhuakhote kha an ni a, an puante Berâmno thisena suin an tivâr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chuvângin, Pathian ṭhutphah hmaah an awm a ni; tin, a chhûn a zânin a biak inah chuan a rawng an bâwl ṭhîn; tin, lalṭhutphaha ṭhua chuan an chungah a puan in chu a zâr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An rilṭâm leh tawh lo vang a, an tuihâl leh tawh hek lo vang; niin a em hek lo vang a, lum rêng rêng pawhin a tihrehawm hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Berâmno, lalṭhutphah laia awm chu an vêngtu a ni ang a, nunna tuikhurahte a hruai ang; Pathianin an mit ata mittui zawng zawng a hru fai tawh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, chhinchhiahna pasarihna chu a han phelh veleh, dâr chanve lai vân chu a reh ta ṭhuap a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Pathian hmaa vântirhkoh pasarih ding ṭhînte chu ka hmu a; tin, an hnênah tawtawrâwt pasarih an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, vântirhkoh dang a lo kal a, rangkachak rimtui hâlna bâwm kengin maichâm kiangah chuan a ding ta a: tin, lalṭhutphah hmaa rangkachak maichâm chunga mi thianghlim zawng zawng ṭawngṭainate belhchhahna tûrin, englo rimtui tam tak a hnênah an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, englo rimtui khu chu vântirhkoh kut ata Pathian hmaah a chho ta a, mi thianghlimho ṭawngṭainate nên chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, vântirhkoh chuan englo rimtui hâlna bâwm chu a la a, maichâma meiin a tikhat a, leiah a paih thla ta a; tichuan, khawpui ri te, aw te, kâwlphe te, lîrnghîng te a lo awm ve ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, vântirhkoh pasarih, tawtawrâwt pasarih kengte chu hâm tûrin an inbuatsaih ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, a hmasa ber chuan a han hâm a; tichuan, rial leh mei, thisen nêna inpawlh a lo awm ta nghâl a, chûng chu leiah paih thlâkin a awm ta a; tichuan, lei hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat chu a kâng ral ta a, thingte pawh hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat chu a kâng ral a, hlobet hring zawng zawng pawh a kâng ral ta bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, vântirhkoh pahnihna chuan a han hâm a; tichuan, tlâng lian pui, meia kâng lai ang hi tuifinriatah an paih thla a; tichuan, tuifinriat hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat chu thisenah a lo chang ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tuifinriata thilsiam, nunna neite chu, hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat chu an thi ta bawk a; lawngte pawh hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat chu tihchhiat a ni ta bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, vântirhkoh pathumna chuan a han hâm a; tichuan, arsi lian pui, meichher anga alh hi vân aṭangin a lo tla a, lui hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat leh tuikhurte chu a delh ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />chu arsi hming chu sai a ni a; tui hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat chu saiah a lo chang ta a; tichuan, chu tui chu an in a, mi tam tak an thi a, a lo khâk tâk avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, vântirhkoh palina chuan a han hâm a; tichuan, ni hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat, thla pawh hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat, arsite pawh hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat chu tihchhiat a ni ta a; chûngho hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat chu a thimna tûr leh, chhûn chu hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat a ên lohna tûrin; zân pawh chutiang bawkin a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, ka han en a, mupui, vânlaizâwla thlâwkin aw ring takin, “Vântirhkoh pathum tawtawrâwt la hâm tûr, chumi ri lo la awm tûrte avâng chuan leia awmhote chung a pik e, a pik e, a pik e!” a tih ka hria a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, vântirhkoh pangana chuan a han hâm a; tichuan, arsi, vân aṭanga leia tla sa ka hmu a; tin, leilâwt khuarkhurum chabi chu a hnênah an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan leilâwt khuarkhurum chu a hawng a; tichuan, khuarkhurum ata chu meikhu, rawh tuina mei nasa tak khu ang a chhuak chho va; tin, khuarkhuruma meikhu avâng chuan ni leh boruak chu a lo thim ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, meikhu zîng aṭang chuan leiah khaute a lo chhuak a; tin, leia khawmualkaikuangten thiltihtheihna an nei ang hian, an hnênah thiltihtheihna an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, an chala Pathian chhinchhiahna nei lo mihringte chauh lo chu, leia hlobet te, thil hring rêng rêng te, thing rêng rêng te pawh tihchhiat loh tûr tih an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah chuan mihringte chu tihlum êm lova, thla nga tihrehawm zâwk tûrin thu an pe a; an tihhrehawmzia chu khawmualkaikuangin mi a seha a tihrehawm ang hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chûng nîah chuan miten thihna an zawng ang a, an hmu hauh si lo vang; thih an châk ang a, nimahsela, thihna chuan a tlânsan ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, khaute pianzia chu sakawr, indona tûra peih sa ang an ni; lallukhum ang mai rangkachak ang an khum a, an hmai pawh mihring hmai ang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, hmeichhe sam ang hi sam an nei a, an hâte pawh chu sakeibaknei hâ ang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, thîr âwmphaw ang hi âwmphaw an nei a; tin, an thla zah ri chu indona tawlailîr ri, sakawr tam tak indo tûra tlân dur dur ri ang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, khawmualkaikuang mei ang hi mei an nei a, sehna pawh; tin, an meiah chuan a ni thla nga chhûnga an mihring tihnat theihna chu a awm ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Leilâwt tirhkoh chu an chunga lalberah an nei a, Hebrai ṭawngin a hming chu Abaddona a ni a, Grik ṭawng erawh chuan a hming chu Apolluona (Tiboraltua) a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chungpikna hmasa ber chu a reh tawh a; ngai teh, tûn hnuah Chungpikna pahnih a la awm leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, vântirhkoh parukna chuan a han hâm a; tichuan, Pathian hmaa rangkachak maichâm ki aṭangte chuan aw ka hria a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />chu aw chuan vântirhkoh parukna, tawtawrâwt keng hnênah chuan, “Euphrates luipuia vântirhkoh pali phuarte kha phelh rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, chumi dârkâr leh ni leh thla leh kum atân chuan, mihring hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat tihlum tûra buatsaih tawh vântirhkoh palite chu an phelh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, sipai, sakawr chung chuangho chu an tam lam chu sîng hlîra hmun sînghnih a ni tih an sawi ka hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, inlârnaah chuan sakawr leh an chunga chuanghote chu hetiangin ka hmu a ni, mei leh huakintho leh kât ang hi âwmphaw an nei a; tin, sakawr lute chu sakeibaknei lû ang hi a ni a, an kâ aṭang chuan mei leh meikhu leh kâtte a chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chumi hremna pathum chuan mihring hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat an tihlum ta a - mei leh meikhu leh kât an kâ aṭanga chhuak khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sakawrte thiltihtheihna chu an kâah leh an meiah a ni a awm ni; an meite chu rûl ang a ni si a, lûte an nei bawk a; chu chuan a ni mi an tihnat ṭhin ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, mihring, chûng hremnaa tihhlum bângte chuan ramhuaite leh rangkachak milem te, tangkaraw milem te, dâr milem te, lung milem te, thing milem te, eng mah hmu thei hlei lo, hre thei hlei lo, kal thei hlei lote chu an biak tawh lohna tûrin an kuta thiltihte chu an sim chuang lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />an tualthahte pawh, an dawi hmante pawh, an inngaihte pawh, an rûkrûkte pawh an sim chuang hek lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, vântirhkoh chak tak dang pakhat, chhûma inthuam, vân aṭanga lo chhuk ka hmu a; a lûah chuan chhimbâl chu a zâm a, a hmêl chu ni ang a ni a, a kete chu mei ban ang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, a kut chuan lehkhabu tê tak tê hawn sa a keng a; tin, a ke ding lamin tuifinriat a rap a, a vei lamin khawmual a rap a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, sakeibaknei hahum angin aw ring takin a au ta a; tin, a au zawh chuan khawpui ri pasarihte chuan an aw an chhuah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, khawpui ri pasarihte chuan an aw an chhuah veleh ka ziak dâwn a; tichuan, “Khawpui ri pasarihte thusawi chu zêp tlat la, ziak suh,” tiin vân aṭangin aw ka hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, vântirhkoh, tuifinriat leh khawmuala ding ka hmuha chuan a kut ding lam chu vân lamah a phar a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />chatuana nung renga, vân, a chhûnga thil awmte nên, lei, a chhûnga thil awmte nên, tuifinriat, a chhûnga thil awmte nêna siamtu chu chhâlin, “Hun a awm tawh lo vang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />nimahsela, vântirhkoh pasarihna thâwm a awm hunah, a ham dâwn ṭêpin, Pathian thurûk chu a kim tawh ang, a bâwih zâwlneite hnêna a Chanchin Ṭha hrilh ang khân,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, vân ata aw ka hriat khân mi be leh a, “Tuifinriat leh khawmuala ding vântirhkoh kuta lehkhabu hawn sa saw va la rawh,” a tih ka hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, vântirhkoh hnênah chuan ka va kal a, a hnênah, “Lehkhabu tê tak tê kha mi pe rawh,” ka ti a. Tin, ani chuan ka hnênah, “La la, ei zo vek rawh; tichuan, i pum chu a tikhâ ang a, i kâah erawh chuan khawizu angin a thlum ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, vântirhkoh kut ata lehkhabu tê tak tê chu ka la a, ka ei zo vek a; tichuan, ka kâah chuan khawizu angin a thlum a; nimahsela, ka ei zawh veleh ka pum chu a kha zo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, ka hnênah, “Mi tam tak te, hnam tam tak te, ṭawng tam tak te, lal tam tak te chungchâng thu i hril leh ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, luang, tiang ang hi mi pe a; tichuan, tuin emaw, “Tho la, Pathian biak in, maichâm nên, a chhûnga betute nên teh rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Biak in pâwn lama hung chhûng kawtlai erawh chu teh tel suh, chu chu Jentail-te hnêna pêk a ni tawh si a; anni chuan Khaw Thianghlim chu thla sawmli leh thla hnih an rap bet ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, ka thuhretu pahnihte hnênah chuan thu ka pe ang a; tichuan, saiip puan sinin ni sângkhat leh zahnih leh sawmruk chhûng zawng thu an hril ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chûng chu olive thing pahnih leh khâwnvâr dahna pahnih, khawvêl lal hmaa dingte chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, anni chu tu pawhin tihnat an tum chuan, an kâ aṭangin mei a lo chhuak a, an hmêlmate chu a kâng ral ṭhîn. Tin, tu pawhin anni chu tihnat tum ang sela, chutiang bawka tihhlumin an awm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chûngte chuan an thuhril chhûng zawng ruah sûr lo tûra vân tihpin theihna an nei; an duh hun apianga thisena chantîr tûrin tuite chungah thu an nei a, khawvêl hi hremna tinrênga hrem tûrin thu an nei bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, an hriattîrna thu chu an hril zawh huna leilâwt aṭanga sakawlh lo chhuak chho tûr chuan anmahni a do vang a, a hneh ang a, a tihlum ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, an ruang chu khaw ropui kawtthlêrah chuan a awm reng ang a; chu khaw ropui chu thlarau lam thûah chuan Sodom leh Aigupta an ti a ni, chutah bawk chuan an Lalpa chu khenbehin a awm kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, mite zînga mi te, chite zînga mi te, ṭawngte zînga mi te, hnamte zînga miten ni thum leh a chanve an ruangte chu an en ang a, an ruangte chu thlâna phûm an phal lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, an thih avângin leia awmte chu an lâwm ang a, hlimna an siam ang a, lâwmna te an inthawn bawk ang; zâwlnei pahnihte chuan leia awmte chu an tihhrehawm ṭhin avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, ni thum leh a chanve hnuah chuan Pathian hnên ata nunna thaw chu an chhûngah a lo lût a, an kein an ding ta a; tichuan, a hmutute chuan an hlau ta êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah, “Hetah hian lo chho rawh u,” tia vân aṭanga aw ring tak an hria a. Tichuan, chhûm zîngah chuan vânah an chho ta a; an hmêlmate chuan an hmu reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, chumi lai tak chuan lîr nasa takin a lo nghîng a, khua chu hmun sâwma ṭhena hmun khat a chim ta a, lîrnghîngah chuan mi sângsarih an thi a; tin, a bâkte chuan an hlau va, vân Pathian chu an chawimawi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chungpikna pahnihna chu a reh tawh a; ngai teh, Chungpikna pathumna chu a lo thleng thuai dâwn e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, vântirhkoh pasarihna chuan a han hâm a; tichuan, “Khawvêl ram chu kan Lalpa leh a Krista ram a lo ni ta, ani chuan chatuanin ro a rêl ang,” tiin vânah chuan aw ring takte a lo chhuak ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tichuan, Pathian hmaa an lalṭhutphaha upa sawmhnih leh pali ṭhute chu an bawkkhup a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Aw Lalpa Pathian, Engkimtithei, awm mêk leh awm tawh, i thiltihtheihna ropui tak chu laa ro i rêl avângin lâwmthu kan hrilh a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hnamte chu an thinur a; tin, i thinur chu a lo thleng ve thung a, mitthi rorêlsak hun leh, i bâwih zâwlneite hnênah te, mi thianghlimte hnênah te, milian leh mitê, i hming ṭihtute lâwmman pêk hun leh, lei tichhetute tihchhiat ve thung hun chu a lo thleng bawk a,” tiin Pathian chibai an bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, vâna Pathian biak in chu an hawng a. Tichuan, a biak inah chuan a thuthlunna bâwm chu a lo lang ta a; tin, kâwlphe te, aw te, khawpui ri te, lîrnghîng te, rial nasa tak te a lo awm ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, thilmak ropui tak vânah a lo lang ta a; hmeichhia, nîa inthuam, a ke hnuaia thla awm, arsi sâwm leh pahniha siam lallukhum khum a lo awm a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ani chuan nau a pai a; nau vei nâin a sa hrâm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, thilmak dang vânah a lo lang leh a; ngai teh, dragon sen lian pui, lû sarih leh ki sâwm nei, lallukhum pasarih khum a lo awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A mei chuan vân arsi hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat chu a hnûk a, leiah a paih thla ta a; tin, a hrin huna a nau chu a lem theih nân, dragon chu hmeichhe nau hring tûr hmaah chuan a ding reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, fapa, hnam zawng zawng chunga thîrtianga rorêl tûr a hring a; tin, a fa chu Pathian hnênah leh a lalṭhutphahah chuan lâk chhohvin a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, hmeichhia chu thlalêra Pathian buatsaih hmun a neihnaah chuan a tlân bo va, chutah chuan ni sângkhat leh zahnih leh sawmruk an châwm theihna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, vânah chuan indona a lo awm a; Mikaela leh a vântirhkohte chuan dragon chu an do va; dragon leh a tirhkohte pawh chuan an do ve a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />nimahsela, an hneh ta lo va, an hmun chu vânah a awm ta bawk hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, dragon lian pui, rûlpui tar, Diabola leh Setana an tih, khawvêl zawng zawng bumtu chu an paih thla ta a; leiah an paih a, a tirhkohte pawh an paih thla tel ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, vânah chuan aw ring takin, “Tûnah chuan kan Pathian chhandamna leh thiltihtheihna leh ram chu a lo thleng ta, a Krista thuneihna nên; kan unaute hêktu, kan Pathian hmaa a chhûn a zâna hêk ṭhîntu chu an paih thla ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nimahsela, Berâmno thisen avâng leh an hriattîrna thu avângin ani chu an hneh a ni; thih ngam khawpin an nunna an ngainêp bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuvângin, aw, vânte leh a chhûnga awmte u, lâwm rawh u! Lei leh tuifinriat chung a pik e! Diabola chu hun tlêm tê chauh a nei tih a inhriat avânga thinur êm êma in hnêna a lo chhuk tâk avângin,” a tih ka hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, dragon chuan leia paih thlâk a ni tih a inhriat veleh, fapa hringtu hmeichhia chu a tiduhdah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, thlalêra a hmunah chuan a thlawh luh theih nân, hmeichhia chu mupui lian tak thla khing hnih an pe a, chutah chuan rûlpui hmuh phâk lohvah, hun khat leh hunte leh hun chanve chhûng zawng an châwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, rûlpui chuan tuia a len botîr theih nân, hmeichhe hnungah chuan lui ang mai hian a kâ ata tui a pik chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nimahsela, leiin hmeichhia chu a ṭanpui a, lei chuan a kâ a âng a, dragon-in a kâ ata a pik chhuah lui chu a lem zo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, dragon chu hmeichhe chungah chuan a lo thinur a, a thlah la awm, Pathian thupêkte zâwma Isua hriattîrna thu pawmte chu do tûrin a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, tuifinriat ṭiauphovah chuan a ding ta a. Tin, sakawlh ki sâwm leh lû sarih nei, tuifinriat aṭanga lo chhuak ka hmu a, a kîahte chuan lallukhum sâwm a awm a, a luahte chuan Pathian sawichhiatna hmingte a awm bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, ka sakawlh hmuh chu keitê ang a ni a, a kete chu savawm ke ang a ni a, a ka chu sakeibaknei ka ang a ni; tin, dragon chuan a hnênah a thiltihtheihna leh a lalṭhutphah leh thuneihna nasa tak a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, a lû pakhat chu thihpui khawp hiala hliam angin ka hmu a; nimahsela, a thihpui khawp hial tûra hliam chu a dam ta a; tichuan, leia mi zawng zawngin sakawlh chu mak an ti a, an zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, sakawlh hnênah chuan a thuneihna chu a pêk avângin, dragon chu Pathian chibai bûkin an bûk a; tin, “Sakawlh ang hi tu nge awma, tu nge do thei awm?” tiin sakawlh pawh chu an bûk bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, uanna leh Pathian sawichhiatna kâ a hnênah pêk a ni a, thla sawmli leh pahnih che tûrin thu pêk a ni bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, Pathian sawichhiain a kâ a âng ta a, a hming leh a awmna vâna awmhote chu sawi chhe tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, mi thianghlimte a do leh a hneh phal a ni a; chi tinrêng te, mi tinrêng te, ṭawng tinrêng te, hnam tinrêng te chunga thuneihna a hnênah pêk a ni bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, leia awm zawng zawng, leilung pian tirha talh tawh Berâmno Nunna Bua hming ziak loh apiang chuan, Pathian chibai bûkin an bûk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tu pawhin beng an neih chuan hre rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tu pawh sala awm tûr chu salah an awm ang, tu pawh khandaiha thi tûr chu khandaiha tihhlum an ni ang. Hetah hian mi thianghlimte chu chhel tak leh rinawm taka an awm a ṭulzia a lang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, sakawlh dang lei aṭanga lo chhuak ka hmu a; berâmno kî ang kî pahnih a nei a, dragon ṭawng angin a ṭawng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sakawlh hmasa zâwk thuneihna zawng zawng kha a mit hmuhah a hmang a. Lei leh a chhûnga awm zawng zawng chu sakawlh hmasa zâwk, thihpui khawp hial tûra hliam dam leha chu chibai a bûktîr bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, mihring mit hmuhah vân aṭanga leia mei tlâktîr thei khawp hialin thilmak ropui tak a ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Leia awmte hnênah sakawlh, khandaiha hliam hnu la dama chawimawi nân ama lim an siam tûr a ni tih sawiin, sakawlh mit hmuha thilmak ti tûra thu a hmuh, chûng thilmak avâng chuan leia awmte chu a bum bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, sakawlh lim chu a ṭawng theihna tûr leh, sakawlh lim chibai bûk lo apiang a tihhlumtîr theih bawkna tûrin, sakawlh lim hnênah chuan thâwkna a pêk phal a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, mi zawng zawng a lian a têin, a hausa a retheiin, bâwih leh bâwih lo pawh, an kut ding lamah emaw, an chalah emaw chhinchhiahna a neihtîr hlawm a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />chhinchhiahna - sakawlh hming emaw, a hming nambar emaw - neite chauh lo chuan tu mân eng mah an lei leh an hralh theih loh nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hetah hian fin a ṭulzia a lang. Chhût thiam chuan sakawlh nambar chu chhût rawh se; mihring nambar a ni si a; a zât chu zaruk leh sawmruk leh paruk a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, ka han en a; tin, ngai teh, Berâmno, Zion tlânga ding leh, an chala a hming leh a Pa hming ziak mi nuai khat leh sîngli leh sângli a hnênah ka hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, vân aṭanga englo ri, tui tam tak ri ang leh khawpui ri nasa tak ang ka hria a; tin, ka ri hriat chu ṭingṭang kaituten an ṭingṭang kaih ri ang a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />lalṭhutphah hmaah leh Thil nung pali leh upate hmaah chuan hla thar ni âwm tak hi an sa a; tin, lei ata tlan tawh mi nuai khat leh sîngli leh sângli chauh lo kha chuan, tu mân chu hla chu an zir thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chûng chu hmeichhe laka intibawlhhlawh lote chu an ni; nula thianghlim ang an ni si a. Chûng chu Berâmno kalna apianga zuitute chu an ni. Chûng chu Pathian tân leh Berâmno tân rah hmasa ber ni tûrin, mihring zîng ata tlan an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An kâah dâwt a chhuah rêng miin an hre ngai lo; sawisêl bo an ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, leia awmte hnênah leh hnam tinrêng te, chi tinrêng te, ṭawng tinrêng te, mi tinrêng te hnêna tlângaupui tûra, chatuana Chanchin Ṭha nei vântirhkoh dang vanlaizâwla thlâwk ka hmu a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tin, ani chuan aw ring takin, “A rorêl hun chu a lo thlen tâk avângin Pathian chu hlau ula, chawimawi rawh u; vân te, lei te, tuifinriat te, tuihna te siamtu chu chibai bûk rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, vântirhkoh dang, a pahnihna chuan, “Babulon khaw ropui, a mi ngaih chîn vânga thinurna uain hnam zawng zawng intîrtu chu a tlâwm ta, a tlâwm ta,” tiin a rawn zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, vântirhkoh dang, a pathumna chuan aw ring takin, “Tu pawhin sakawlh leh a lem chibai bûkin, an chalah emaw, an kutah emaw chhinchhiahna an neih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />chûng mite ngei chuan Pathian thinurna uain, a thinurna nova eng mah pawlh lova siam chu an in ang a, vântirhkoh thianghlimte mit hmuh leh Berâmno mit hmuhah chuan mei leh kâta nghaisakin an awm bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, chûng mite nghaisakna meikhu chu chatuanin a chho vang a; sakawlh leh a lim chibai bûktute, a hming chhinchhiahna nei apiangte pawh chuan a chhûn a zânin chawlh rêng an nei lo vang,” tiin anni chu a rawn zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi thianghlim, Pathian thupêk awihtute leh Isua zuitu rinawmte tân hetah hian chhel a ṭûlzia a lang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, vân aṭangin awin, “Heti hian ziak rawh: ‘Tûn hnuah chuan mitthi, Lalpaa thite chu an eng a thâwl ang; Thlarauvin, “A ni, an thawh rimnate chu an chawlhsan tawh ang; an thiltihte chuan a rawn zui ve dâwn si a,” a ti e,’ ” a tih ka hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, ka han en a; tin, ngai teh, chhûm vâr ka hmu a; tin, chhûm chungah chuan mihring fapa ang tak hi, rangkachak lallukhum khuma favah hriam tak kenga ṭhu ka hmu bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, vântirhkoh dang, Pathian biak in aṭangin a lo chhuak a, chhûm chunga ṭhu hnênah chuan aw ring takin, “I favah kha phawrh la, ât rawh; ah a hun tawh si a; khu, lei buh a ngui tawh khu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tichuan, chhûm chunga ṭhu chuan a favah chu leiah a thlâk a, lei buh chu an ât ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, vântirhkoh dang, vâna Pathian biak in aṭangin a lo chhuak leh a, ani pawh chuan favah hriam tak a keng bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, vântirhkoh dang, mei chunga thuneitu chu maichâm aṭangin a lo chhuak leh a; tin, ani chuan aw ring takin, “I favah hriam tak kha phawrh la, leia grêp hrui rah bâwrte khu zuk ât rawh; grêp rahte khu a hmin ṭuah tawh khu,” tiin favah hriam tak kengtu chu a au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tichuan, vântirhkoh chuan a favah chu leiah a thlâk a, leia grêp rah chu a ât a, grêp sâwrna khur zau tak, Pathian thinurna grêp sâwrna khurah chuan a theh lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, khaw pâwn lama grêp sâwrna khurah chuan an rap sâwr a; tichuan, grêp sâwrna khur aṭang chuan thisen a lo chhuak a, fîng sângkhat leh zaruka thui, nghâwng thlenga thûk a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, vânah chhinchhiahna dang, ropui tak leh mak tak ka hmu a, vântirhkoh pasarih hremna pasarih kengte chu; chu chu hremna hnuhnûng berte a ni, chûngah chuan Pathian thinurna chu a kin tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, dârthlalang mei nêna inpawlh tuifinriat ni âwm tak ka hmu a; sakawlh te, a lem te, a hming nambar te hneha lo chhuakte chu Pathian ṭingṭang kenga, dârthlalang tuifinriat kama ding ka hmu bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Pathian bâwih Mosia hla leh Berâmno hla, “Aw Lal Pathian, Engkimtithei, I thiltihte chu a ropuiin a mak a; Nang, hnam tin Lalber, I kawngte chu a felin a dik a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw Lalpa, tu nge i hming zah lo vanga, Chawimawi lo vang? Nang chauh i thianghlim si; I thiltih felte chu tihlan a nih tawh avângin, Hnam tinrêngin chibai an rawn bûk ang che,” tih hi an sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chûng hnuah chuan ka han en a; tin, vâna hriattîrna biak bûk pindan chhûngnung chu an hawng a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tichuan, pindan chhûngnung aṭang chuan hremna pasarih keng vântirhkoh pasarihte chu puan thianghlim vâr tak sinin, an âwma rangkachak kâwnghrêna inhrêngin an lo chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Thil nung pali zînga pakhat chuan vântirhkoh pasarihte hnênah chuan, Pathian, chatuana nung renga thinurnaa khat rangkachak berhbu pasarih a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, pindan chhûngnung chu Pathian ropuina leh a thiltihtheihna khuin a khat ta a; vântirhkoh pasarihte hremna pasarih chu a reh hma loh zawng, pindan chhûngnungah chuan tu mah an lût thei lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, pindan chhûngnung aṭang chuan aw ring takin, vântirhkoh pasarihte hnênah chuan, “Kal ula, Pathian thinurna berhbute chu leiah leih baw rawh u,” a tih ka hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, a hmasa ber chu a kal a, a berhbu chu leiah a leih bua a; tichuan, sakawlh chhinchhiahna neite leh a lem chibai bûktute chungah chuan, pânchhia na takah a chang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, a pahnihna chuan a berhbu chu tuifinriatah a leih bua a; tichuan, mitthi thisen angin thisenah a chang ta a; chutichuan, thil nung tinrêng tuifinriata awmte chu an thi ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, a pathumna chuan a berhbu chu luiahte leh tuikhurahte a leih bua a; tichuan, thisenah a chang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, tui vântirhkoh chuan, “Nang Mi Thianghlim, hetianga ro i rêl avâng hian, nang awm mêk leh awm tawh, i fel e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Anni chuan mi thianghlimte leh zâwlneite thisen an chhuah a, nangin in tûra thisen vêk i pêk thung hi; in tlâk an ni rêng e,” a tih ka hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, maichâm chuan, “A ni, aw Lalpa Pathian, Engkimtithei, i rorêlte chu a dikin a fel a ni,” a tih ka hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, a palina chuan a berhbu chu nîah a leih bua a; tichuan, ni chu meia mihring em ût tûrin thiltihtheihna an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, mite chu sa tak em uhin an awm a, chûng hremna chunga thuneitu Pathian hming chu an sawi chhia a, amah chawimawi tûrin an sim chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, a pangana chuan a berhbu chu sakawlh lalṭhutphahah a leih bua a; tichuan, a ram chu a lo thim ta vek a; tin, an nat avângin an lei an seh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />an nâte leh an pânte avângin vân Pathian chu an sawi chhia a; an thiltihte chu an sim chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, a parukna chuan a berhbu chu tuipui, Euphrates-ah chuan a leih bua a; tichuan, ni chhuahna lam aṭanga lal lo kal tûrte tâna kawng chu peih sa a lo nih theih nân, a tui chu a kangchat ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, dragon kâ aṭang leh, sakawlh kâ aṭang leh, zâwlnei der kâ aṭang chuan thlarau bawlhhlawh pathum, chungû ni âwm tak lo chhuak ka hmu a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />chûng chu ramhuai thlarau, thilmak ti ṭhînte an ni; anni chu Pathian Engkimtitheia ni ropuiah indonaa hruai khâwm tûrin, khawvêl zawng zawnga lalte hnênah an kal a
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />(Ngai teh, rûkru angin ka lo kal dâwn e; inringa puan veng chu a eng a thâwl e; chuti lo chuan, saruakin a lêng ang a, a zahmawh an hmu dah ang e),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />hmun pakhat, Hebrai ṭawnga Har-magedon an tihah chuan an hruai khâwm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, a pasarihna chuan a berhbu chu boruakah a leih bua a; tichuan, pindan chhûngnung aṭangin Lalṭhutphah ata, “A kin ta,” tiin aw ring tak a lo chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, kâwlphe te, aw te, khawpui ri te a lo awm ta a; lîr pawh nasa takin a lo nghîng a, leia mihring awm achin chutianga nasa rêng rêng a la awm ngai lo, lîrnghîng chuti kauva nasa leh râpthlâk chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tichuan, khaw ropui chu hmun thumah a lo inṭhen a, hnam tin khuate chu a lo chim a; tin, a thinur nasatna uain no chu a hnêna pêk tûrin, Babulon khaw ropui chu Pathian hmaah hriat rengin a lo awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, thliarkâr tinrêng a bo ta vek a, tlângte pawh a awm ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, rial lian tak, talent tluk laia rit ṭheuh vân aṭangin mihringte chungah a tla a; tin, mihringte chuan riala hremna avâng chuan Pathian an sawi chhe ta a; chu hremna chu a nasa êm êm si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, vântirhkoh pasarih, berhbu pasarih kengte zînga pakhat chuan mi bia a, “Hawh teh, tui tam taka ṭhu nawhchizuar ropui tak hremna chu ka entîr ang che;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />leia lalte chuan ani chu an ngai ṭhîn a, leia awmte pawh chu a mi ngaih chînna uain chuan hrai ruihin an awm ṭhîn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chutichuan, ani chuan Thlarauvin thlalêrah mi kalpui a; tin, Pathian sawichhiatna hminga khat, lû sarih leh ki sâwm nei sakawlh sen tak chunga chuang hmeichhia ka hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chu hmeichhia chuan puan sen duk leh sen lâr a sin a, rangkachak leh lung man tam leh tuikeplungin a inchei a, rangkachak no, thil tenawm, a mi ngaih chînna thil bawlhhlawha khat a keng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />a chalah chuan thurûk, ‘Babulon Khaw Ropui, Leia Nawhchizuarte leh Thil Tenawmte Nu,’ tia hming ziak a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, chu hmeichhia chu mi thianghlimte thisen leh Isua martarho thisena ruiin ka hmu a. Ka hmuh veleh mak ka ti êm êm mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, vântirhkoh chuan ka hnênah, “Eng vângin nge mak i tih? Kha hmeichhia leh a phurtu sakawlh, lû sarih leh ki sâwm nei thurûk chu ka hrilh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sakawlh i hmuh kha a awm tawh zet a, a awm leh ta lo va; tin, leilâwt aṭangin a lo chhuak chho vang a, boralnaah a kal ang. Tin, leia awmte, leilung pian tirh ata Nunna Bua hming ziak lohte chuan sakawlh chu an hmuh hunah, a awm tawh zet a, a awm leh ta lo va, a lo kal leh dâwn chu mak an la ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hetah hian fin thiam a ṭûlzia a lang. Lu sarihte chu hmeichhe ṭhutna tlâng sarihte chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lal pasarih pawh an ni a; pangate chu an tlâwm ta a, pakhat chu a la awm a, pakhat chu a lo la awm rih lo va; a lo awm hunah chuan rei lo tê a awm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, sakawlh, awm tawh zeta, awm leh ta lova ngei pawh kha a pariatna a ni a, pasarihte zînga mi kha a ni nghe nghe a; boralnaah a la kal ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, ki sâwm i hmuhte kha lal sâwm, ram la nei lote an ni a; dârkâr khat chhûng erawh chu sakawlh nên thuneihna an la chang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chûng chuan thu khat vuain an thiltihtheihna leh thuneihna chu sakawlh an pe ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chûng chuan Berâmno chu an do vang a; tin, Berâmno chu hotute Hotu leh lalte Lal a nih avângin anni chu a hneh ang a; tin, a hnêna awm - kohte, thlante, rinawmte chuan an hneh bawk ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, amah vêk chuan ka hnênah, “Nawhchizuar ṭhutna tui i hmuhte kha, mi te, mipui te, hnam te, ṭawng te a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ki sâwm i hmuh leh sakawlh ngei chuan nawhchizuar chu an hua ang a, eng mah nei lo leh saruakin an siam ang a, a sa pawh an ei ang a, meiin an hâl ral ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathian thute chu a thlen hma loh chuan a duh zâwng an tihna tûr leh, thu khat an lo vuakna tûr leh, an ram chu sakawlh hnêna an pêkna tûrin Pathianin an thinlungah a tîr si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, i hmeichhe hmuh kha khaw ropui, leia lalte chunga rorêltu chu a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chûng hnuah chuan vântirhkoh dang, thuneihna nasa tak neiin vân ata lo chhuk ka hmu a; a ropuinain lei chu a ên ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan aw ring takin, “Babulon khaw ropui chu a tlâwm ta, a tlâwm ta, ramhuaite awmna leh, thlarau bawlhhlawh tinrêng kulhbîng leh sava bawlhhlawh leh tenawm tinrêng kulhbîng a lo ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A mi ngaih chîn vânga thinurna uain chu hnam zawng zawngin an in tawh si a; leia lalte chuan ani chu an ngai ṭhîn a, leia sumdâwngtute chuan a nawmsak bâwl lutukna chu an hausak phah ṭhîn,” tiin a au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, vân aṭangin aw dangin heti hian a sawi ka hria: “Ka mite u, a sualnaahte in tel lohna tûr leh, a hremnate in hmuh ve lohna tûrin, a chhûng ata chhuak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A sualnate chuan vân pawh a tawng ta hial a, Pathianin a thiltih fel lote pawh chu a hre reng si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Anin a pêk ang ngei khân pe thung ula, a thiltih ang zêl chu a leh hnihin thungrûl ula, a chawhpawlhna novah chuan a tân a leh hnihin chawhpawlhsak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A intihropui leh a intihnawmsak ang zêl khân nghaisain tilungngai thung rawh u; a rilru chuan, ‘Lalnuah ka ṭhu a ni, hmeithai rêng ka ni lo va, lungngaihna ka hmu hauh lo vang,’ a ti si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chuvângin, ni khat chauhvah a hremna - thih te, lungngaih te, ṭâm te chu - a lo thleng vek ang; meia hâl ralin a awm bawk ang; a rorêltu Lalpa Pathian chu a chak si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, leia lal, a ngai ṭhînte leh nawmsak bâwlpui ṭhînte chuan, a kâng khu chu an thlîr hunah chuan, ‘Babulon khaw ropui, khaw nghet chu a chung a pik e, a pik e! Dârkâr khat chauhvah i chungah rorêlna chu a lo thleng ta si,’ tiin, nghaisakna a tuar chu hlauh vânga hla taka dinga, a chunga ṭapin an âwm an inchûm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, leia sumdâwngtute chu a chunga ṭapin an lungngai a, tu mân an sum an lei tâk loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An sumte chu rangkachak te, tangkarua te, lung man tam te, tuikeplung te, puan zai sîn te, puan sen duk te, maimaw puan te, puan sen lâr te nên; thing rimtui tinrêng te, saingho bungbêl tinrêng te, thing hlu tak tak leh dâr leh thîr leh sailungvâra siam bungbêl tinrêngte nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />thakthîng te, englo rimtui te, englo rimtui hâl mi te, hriak rimtui te, beraw te, uain te, olive hriak te, chhangphut dip tak te, buh te, sebâwng te, berâm te nên; sakawr te, tawlailîr te, bâwih te nên; mihring nunna te nên a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Rah i thinlungin a châkte chuan a kal bosan chia, thil tuihnai leh mawi zawng zawng chuan a boralsan chia, tu mân an hmu leh tawh tawp lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chûng thila sumdâwngtu, amah avânga lo hausate chuan, ‘Khaw ropui, puan zai sîn leh puan sen duk leh puan sen lâr sina, rangkachak leh lung man tam leh tuikeplunga incheii chu a chung a pik e, a pik e! Dârkâr khat chauhvah sum chuti zozai chu eng mah lo a lo nih tâk hi,’ tiin, ṭap leh lungngai chungin a nghaisakna hlauh vângin hla takah an ding ang. Tin, lawng hotu apiang te, lawnga kal ṭhîn apiang te, lawng mi te, tuifinriata hnathawk apiang te chu hla taka dingin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />a kâng khu chu thlîr chungin, ‘He khaw ropui tluk hi khawii khua nge awm ang?’ tiin an au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, ṭap leh lungngai chungin, ‘A muk avânga tuifinriata lawng neitute hausakna khaw ropui chu a chung a pik e, a pik e! Dârkâr khat chauhvah eng mah lo a lo nih tâk hi!’ tia auvin, an lu vaivutin an theh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aw, vân leh nangni mi thianghlimte, tirhkohte, zâwlneite u, lâwm rawh u; ani chuan in chunga ro a rêlna chuan Pathianin a chungah ro a rêl ve tâk hi,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, vântirhkoh chak tak hian buh râwt sawmna lung lian pui ang hi lung a la a, tuifinriatah a paih thla a, “Babulon khaw ropui chu hetianga nasa hian paih thlâk a ni ang a, tu mân an hmu leh tawh tawp lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ṭingṭang kaituho te, englo tum thiamho te, phênglâwng tumtuho te, tawtawrâwtpuho te thâwm pawh i chhûngah an hre leh tawh tawp lo vang a; themthiam kawng rêng rênga themthiam te pawh i chhûngah an hmu leh tawh tawp lo vang a; buh râwt sawmna lung ri pawh i chhûngah an hre leh tawh tawp lo vang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />khâwnvâr pawh i chhûngah a êng tawh tawp lo vang a; pasal leh mo thâwm pawh i chhûngah an hre tawh tawp lo vang; i sumdâwngtute chu leia mi liante an ni si a; i dawiin hnam zawng zawng bum an nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A chhûngah zâwlneite, mi thianghlimte, leia thah zawng zawngte thisen chu an hmu a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chûng hnuah chuan vânah mipui tam tak aw ring tak ni âwm tak hian, “Halleluia! Chhandamna te, ropuina te, thiltihtheihna te kan Pathian ta a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a rorêlnate chu a dikin a fel a ni; ani chuan nawhchizuar ropui tak, a mi ngaih chîn vânga lei tikhawlotu chu ro a rêl a, a bâwihte thisen chhuak phuba chu a kuta a lâk tâk hi,” a tih ka hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, “Halleluia!” an ti leh a. Tin, a khu chu chatuanin a chho vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, upa sawmhnih leh pali leh Thil nung palite chu an bawkkhup a, “Amen; Halleluia!” tiin, Pathian, lalṭhutphaha ṭhu chu chibai an bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, lalṭhutphah aṭang chuan aw a lo chhuak a, “Nangni a bâwih zawng zawng, a zahtu mi lian leh mi tête u, kan Pathian chu fak rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, mipui tam tak aw ang leh, tui tam tak ri ang leh, khawpui nasa tak ri angin, “Halleluia! Lalpa kan Pathian Engkimtitheia chuan ro a rêl tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hlim takin lâwm ila, amah i chawimawi ang u, Berâmno nupui neih chu a hun ta si a, a nupui pawh a inpeih tawh,” a tih ka hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Puan zai sîn fai tak, vâr tak sin an phal a, puan zai sîn chu mi thianghlimte thiltih fel a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, “ Berâmno nupui neihna ruai ṭheha sâwmte chu an eng a thâwl e, tiin ziak rawh,” mi ti a. Tin, ka hnênah, “Hêng thu hi Pathian thutak a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, Pathian chibai bûka bûk tûrin a ke bulah ka bawkkhup a. Tin, ani chuan ka hnênah, “Heti chuan ti suh khai; kei chu nangmah leh i unau, Isua hriattîrna thu pawmte bâwihpui ka ni alâwm; Pathian chibai bûk zâwk rawh; Isua hriattîrna thu chu thu hrilhna thlarau a ni si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, vân inhawng ka hmu a; tin, ngai teh, sakawr vâr leh a chunga chuang, Rinawm-leh-Diktaka an tih chu ka hmu bawk a; ani chuan fel takin ro a rêl a, mi a do ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A mitte chu mei alh ang a ni a, lallukhum tam tak a khum a; tin, hming ziak, amah chauh lo chuan tu mahin an hriat loh a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Puan thisen kai a sin a; a hmingah chuan, “Pathian - Thua,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, vâna sipaihote chuan puan zai sîn vâr tak, fai tak sinin, sakawr vâr chungahte chuangin an zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, a kâ aṭang chuan khandaih hriam tak a chhuak a, chu chu hnam tin a sahna tûr a ni; tin, thîrtiangin an ro a rêl ang a; Pathian Engkimtitheia thinur nasatna grêp sâwrna khurah chuan a rap sâwr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, a puanah leh a malpuiah chuan, “Lalte Lal leh Hotute Hotu,” tia hming ziak a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, nîah khian vântirhkoh ding ka hmu a; tin, ani chuan vanlaizâwla sava thlâwk zawng zawng hnênah chuan aw ring takin, “Lal sa te, sipai hotu sa te, mi chak sa te, sakawr leh a chunga chuang sa te, mi zawng zawng - bâwih leh bâwih lo, a lian a tê pawh - an sa in ei theihna tûrin, Pathian ruai ropui tak ṭhehnaah chuan rawn inkhâwm rawh u,” tiin a au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, sakawlh te, leia lalho te, an sipaiho te, sakawr chunga chuang kha do tûr leh a sipaiho do tûra an inkhâwm ka hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, sakawlh chu an man a; zâwlnei der, sakawlh chhinchhiahna nei leh a lem chibai bûktute a bum ṭhinna thilmak a mit hmuha titu kha an man tel a; an pahnih chuan kâta kâng meidîlah chuan a nung chungin an paih a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />mi dangte chu sakawr chunga chuang khandaih, a kâ aṭanga chhuak khân sah hlum an ni ta a; sava zawng zawng chu an sate eiin an puar ta vek a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, vântirhkoh, leilâwt chabi leh khaidiat lian pui kengin, vân ata lo chhuk ka hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, dragon, rûlpui tar chu (chu chu Diabola leh Setana a ni) a man a, kum sângkhat atân a phuar a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />leilâwtah chuan a paih lût a, a khâr khum a, kum sângkhat chu a vei hma loh chuan hnam tin a bum leh tawh lohna tûrin a châr hnan ta a; chumi hnuah chuan rei lo tê atân chhuah leh rih tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, lalṭhutphahte ka hmu a, a chungah mi an ṭhu a, an hnênah chuan rorêlna an pe a; tin, Isua hriattîrna thu avâng leh Pathian thu avânga lû tante thlarau leh, sakawlh leh a lem chibai bûk lova, an chalah emaw, an kutah emaw chhinchhiahna nei lote thlarau chu ka hmu bawk a; chûngho chu an lo nung a, kum sângkhat Krista nên rorêlin an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mitthi dangte erawh chu kum sângkhat a vei hma loh chuan an la nung rih lo va. Chu chu thawhlehna hmasa ber chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thawhlehna hmasa bera telte chu an engthâwlin an thianghlim a ni; chûngho chungah chuan thih hnihna chuan thu rêng a nei lo va, Pathian leh Krista puithiamte an ni ang a, amah nên kum sângkhat rorêlin an awm zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, kum sângkhat chu a vei hunah chuan, Setana chu a tânna ata chhuahin a awm ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />lei kil lia hnam te, Goga leh Magoga chu buma indonaa hruai khâwm tûrin a kal chhuak ang; chûngho tamzia chu tuifinriata ṭiauvut ang mai an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, lei vâng lam dâpin an kal chho va, mi thianghlimte riahhmun leh khaw duhawm tak chu an hual ta a; tin, vân aṭangin mei a lo tla a, anni chu a kâng ral ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, anmahni bumtu Diabola chu sakawlh leh zâwlnei der awmna, mei leh kât dîlah chuan an paih ta a; tichuan, chatuanin a chhûn a zâna nghaisakin an awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, lalṭhutphah lian pui, vâr tak leh a chunga ṭhu chu ka hmu a, a hma ata chu lei leh vân an tlân bo va, an tân hmun rêng a awm ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, mitthite chu a lian a têin lalṭhutphah hmaa ding ka hmu a; tin, lehkhabute an hawng a; tin, lehkhabu dang, Nunna Bu chu an hawng bawk a; tin, mitthite chu lehkhabutea ziak an thiltih ang zêla rêlsakin an awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuifinriat chuan a chhûnga mitthi awmte chu a chhuahtîr a, Thihna leh Mitthi Khua chuan an chhûnga mitthi awmte chu an chhuahtîr bawk a; tin, mi tin an thiltih ang zêla rêlsakin an awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Thihna leh Mitthi Khuate chu meidîlah an paih a. Chu chu thih hnihna chu a ni - meidîl chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tu hming pawh Nunna Bua ziak an hmuh loh chuan meidîlah an paih bawk a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, vân thar leh lei thar ka hmu a; vân hmasa leh lei hmasa chu a boral tawh a, tuifinriat pawh a awm tawh lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, khaw thianghlim, Jerusalem thar chu, mo, a pasal ela a inchei anga peih diamin, Pathian hnêna mi vân ata lo chhuk ka hmu bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, lalṭhutphah aṭangin aw ring takin, “Ngai teh, Pathian bâwktê chu mihring zîngah a lo awm ta, Ani chu an hnênah a awm ang a, Anni chu a mite an ni ang a, Pathian ngei chu an hnênah a awm ang a, An Pathian a ni bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An mit ata mittui zawng zawng a hru fai ang a; Thihna a awm leh thei tawh lo vang a, Lungngaih te, ṭah te, nat te pawh A awm leh tawh hek lo vang; Thil hmasate chu a ral ta,” a tih ka hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, lalṭhutphaha ṭhu chuan, “Ngai teh, thil engkim ka siam thar e,” a ti a. Tin, “Ziak rawh, hêng thu hi a rinawmin a dik si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, ka hnênah, “A lo thleng ta. Kei Alpha leh Omega, a Bul leh a Tâwp ka ni. Tuihâl apiang hnênah chuan Nunna Tuikhura mi a thlâwnin ka pe ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hnehtu apiang chuan chûng chu an luah ang a, kei an Pathian ka ni ang a, anni chu ka fate an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, mi dawih te, ringlo te, tenawm te, tual that te, inngaih chîng te, dawithiam te, milem bia te, dawthei zawng zawngte chan tûr chu mei leh kâta kâng dîlah chuan a awm ang; chu chu thih hnihna chu a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, berhbu pasarih keng, hremna hnuhnûng ber pasarih sin vântirhkoh pasarih zînga pakhat chu a lo kal a; ani chuan, “Hawh teh, mo, Berâmno nupui chu kan entîr ang che,” tiin mi bia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan Thlarauvin tlâng lian pui, sâng takah mi kalpui a, Jerusalem khaw thianghlim chu Pathian ropuina neiin, Pathian hnêna mi vân ata lo chhuk mi entîr a. A ênzia chu lung man tam ber ang, jaspi lung ang mai hi a ni a, krustal lung angin a tle a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />kulh ropui leh sâng tak a nei a; kawngkhâr sâwm leh pahnih a nei a, kawngkhâr bulahte chuan vântirhkoh sâwm leh pahnih an awm a; chûng kawngkhârah chuan hming ziak a awm bawk a, chûng chu Israela thlahte hnam sâwm leh hnam hnih hmingte chu a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />chhak lampangah kawngkhâr pathum, hmâr lampangah kawngkhâr pathum, chhim lampangah kawngkhâr pathum, thlang lampangah kawngkhâr pathum a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, chu khaw kulh chuan lungphûm sâwm leh pahnih a nei a, chûngah chuan Berâmno tirhkoh sâwm leh pahnihte hming a chuang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, mi betu chuan khua leh a kawngkhârte leh a kulh chu tehna tûrin rangkachak luang a keng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khua chu inbial vêlin a awm a, a dung lam chu a vâng lam chen a ni; khua chu luang chuan a teh a, fing sîngkhat leh sanghnih a ni. A dung lam leh a vâng lam leh a sân lam chu a inang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, a kulh chu a teh leh a, mihring teh dân pângngaiin (chu chu vântirhkoh teh dân pângngai chu a ni) tawng za leh sawmli leh pali a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, a kulh chu jaspi lunga siam a ni; khua chu dârthlalang thianghlim ang maia rangkachak thianghlima siam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chu khaw kulh lungphûmte chu lung man tam chi tinrênga chei mawi a ni. Lungphûm hmasa ber chu jaspi lung a ni a; a pahnihna chu sapphir lung a ni a; a pathumna chu kalkidon lung a ni a; a palina chu smaragdin lung a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />a pangana chu sardonuk lung a ni a; a parukna chu sardion lung a ni a; a pasarihna chu kruso lung a ni a; a pariatna chu berul lung a ni a; a pakuana chu topazi lung a ni a; a sâwmna chu krusopra lung a ni a; a sâwm leh pakhatna chu huakintho lung a ni a; a sâwm leh pahnihna chu amethusto lung a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, kawngkhâr sâwm leh pahnih chu tuikeplung sâwm leh pahnih a ni; kawngkhâr zawng zawng chu tuikeplung pakhat ṭheuhva siam a ni; tin, chu khaw kawtlai chu rangkachak thianghlim a ni, dârthlalang en tlang theih ang mai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, a chhûngah chuan biak in rêng ka hmu lo va; Lalpa Pathian Engkimtitheia leh Berâmno chu an biak in a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, chu khua chuan a ên tûrin ni a ngai lo va, thla pawh a ngai hek lo; Pathian ropuina chuan a ên a, an khâwnvâr chu Bêrâm No a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, hnam tin a êngah chuan an awm ang a; leia lalte chuan an ropuina an la lût ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, a kawngkate chu chhûnah an khâr tawp lo vang, chutah chuan zân rêng a awm dâwn si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, hnam tin ropuina leh chawimawina an la lût ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, thil bawlhhlawh rêng a lût hauh lo vang a, thil tenawm tite leh dâwt hmangte pawh an lût hek lo vang; Berâmno Nunna Bua hming an ziakte chauh an lût ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a khawpui lai taka nunna tui lui, krustal lung anga tle, Pathian leh Berâmno lalṭhutphah aṭanga lo chhuak mi entîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, lui kam tuakah chuan Nunna Thing, chi hrang sâwm leh pahniha rah, thla kipa rah a awm a; chu thing hnahte chu hnam tin tihdamna tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, ânchhia rêng rêng a awm leh tawh lo vang a, Pathian leh Berâmno lalṭhutphah chu a awm tawh zâwk ang; tichuan, a bâwihte chuan a rawng an bâwl ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a hmêl an hmu ang a, a hming chu an chalah a chuang bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, zân a awm leh tawh lo vang a, khâwnvâr êng leh ni êng an ngai lo vang; Lalpa Pathian chuan anmahni a ên dâwn si a; tichuan, chatuanin ro an rêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan ka hnênah, “Hêng thu hi a rinawmin a dik a ni; tichuan, Lalpa, zâwlneite thlarau Pathian chuan, thil lo thleng thuai tûrte chu a bâwihte hnêna entîr tûrin a vântirhkoh a tîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, ka lo kal thuai dâwn e. He lehkhabu hrilh lâwkna thu pawm apiang an eng a thâwl e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, kei Johana, hêng thil zawng zawng hmutu leh hretu chu ka ni. Tin, ka hriata ka hmuh chuan, hêng thil mi entîrtu vântirhkoh ke bulah chuan Pathian chibai bûka bûk tûrin ka bawkkhup a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan ka hnênah, “Heti chuan ti suh khai; kei chu nangmah leh i unau zâwlneite leh, he lehkhabu thu pawmtute bâwihpui ka ni alâwm; Pathian chibai bûk zâwk rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan ka hnênah, “He lehkhabu hrilh lâwkna thute hi zêp suh; a hun chu a lo thleng dâwn tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi fel lo chu tihfel lohvin awm reng rawh se; mi bawlhhlawh chu tihbawlhhlawhin awm reng rawh se; mi fel chu tihfelin awm reng rawh se; mi thianghlim chu tihthianghlimin awm reng rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Ngai teh, ka lo kal thuai dâwn e; mi tin an thiltih ang zêla pêk tûrin ka lâwmman ka hnênah a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kei Alpha leh Omega, a Hmasaber leh a Hnuhnûngber, a Bul leh a Tâwp ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nunna Thing chungah chuan thu an neih theihna tûr leh, kawngkaah chuan khuaa an luh theihna tûra insu faite chu an eng a thâwl e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pâwnah chuan ui te, dawithiam te, inngaih chîng te, tual that te, milem bia te, dâwt ngaina leh dâwt hmang apiangte chu an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Kei Isua hian kohhranho pawlte tân hêng thu hi in hnêna hriattîr tûrin ka vântirhkoh ka rawn tîr a ni. Davida bulpui leh a thlah, arsi êng tak, vârparh chu ka ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thlarau leh mo chuan, “Lo kal rawh,” an ti a. A hria apiangin, “Lo kal rawh,” ti rawh se. Tuihâl apiang lo kal rawh se; a duh apiangin nunna tui hi a thlâwnin la rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />He lehkhabu hrilh lâwkna thu hria apiang ka hriattîr e: tu pawhin hêng thu hi a belhchhah chuan, he lehkhabua hremna ziakte hi Pathianin a chungah a belhchhah ve ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tin, tu pawhin he hrilh lâwkna lehkhabu thûa mi thu a lâk bo chuan, he lehkhabua ziak Nunna Thing leh Khaw Thianghlima a chan chu Pathianin a la bo ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hêng thu hriattîrtu hian, “A ni, ka lo kal thuai dâwn e,” a ti a. Amen. Lo kal ta che, Lalpa Isu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lalpa Isua khawngaihna chu mi thianghlimte hnênah awm rawh se. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
